# NOTICE — upstream provenance

This project is a fork of **FanCtrl Plus** by **ck9393**:

    https://github.com/ck9393/fanctrlplus

Essentially all of the plugin — the control daemon, the web UI, the dashboard
tiles, the disk and CPU temperature handling — is ck9393's work. This fork adds
IPMI baseboard sensors and SAS/HBA controller temperature as extra per-fan
temperature sources, and renames the plugin so it installs alongside the
original rather than over it.

